WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:09.175
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.035 --> 00:36.911
[panting]

00:38.997 --> 00:40.999
[suspenseful music playing]

00:50.675 --> 00:52.135
[breathing heavily]

00:54.387 --> 00:56.681
[whimpering]

01:10.779 --> 01:13.198
It will look suspicious if you disappear,

01:13.281 --> 01:15.492
so it will make things much easier for us

01:15.575 --> 01:17.786
if there are other people
to witness your death.

01:18.453 --> 01:19.287
[scoffs]

01:19.913 --> 01:21.748
I still have my reputation to keep.

01:22.665 --> 01:24.626
I hope to die
with a little bit of dignity.

01:27.629 --> 01:28.797
[chuckles]

01:29.714 --> 01:31.883
[male servant 1] My lord! My lord!

01:33.259 --> 01:35.178
- [male servant 2] My lord.
- [moaning]

01:35.261 --> 01:36.346
[male servant 3] What is he saying?

01:36.429 --> 01:38.348
[male servant 1] What is wrong, my lord?
Oh! What is that?

01:39.057 --> 01:40.934
[loud clamoring]

01:43.186 --> 01:44.938
[whimpers]

01:47.273 --> 01:48.149
[groaning]

01:53.822 --> 01:55.115
[grunts]

02:10.547 --> 02:12.173
Master! Master!

02:21.099 --> 02:24.310
I will be sure
to make good use of your body.

02:25.687 --> 02:26.938
[moans]

02:43.997 --> 02:44.831
[Jang Uk grunting]

02:52.922 --> 02:54.173
[Jang Uk grunting]

03:04.642 --> 03:05.476
[gasps]

03:07.478 --> 03:08.730
[grunts]

03:08.813 --> 03:10.440
[mages exclaim]

03:12.650 --> 03:13.902
[breathes heavily]

03:17.947 --> 03:18.823
Young master.

03:21.868 --> 03:24.245
[exhales] What are we supposed to do?

03:28.041 --> 03:29.459
[mages laugh]

03:30.835 --> 03:32.003
[Jang Uk] It's fine.

03:32.962 --> 03:33.963
Don't come in.

03:35.048 --> 03:35.882
[Jang Uk sighs]

03:38.927 --> 03:39.761
[Dang-gu] That was close.

03:39.844 --> 03:42.472
Uk actually landed
more blows than last time.

03:42.555 --> 03:44.807
- Are there two matches left?
- Yeah.

03:46.184 --> 03:48.436
[Dang-gu] His opponent for tomorrow
is Cha Beom over there.

03:48.519 --> 03:50.521
Ugh, I would hate to see Uk lose to him.

03:51.272 --> 03:52.565
Should I just go instead?

03:53.274 --> 03:55.235
If I let him win, this will all be over.

03:55.318 --> 03:56.694
Do you think Uk would want that?

03:56.778 --> 03:59.322
I mean this was
a bet with the Crown Prince.

03:59.405 --> 04:01.032
It will simply be outsmarting him.

04:04.202 --> 04:05.995
Uk may be losing,
but he's still improving.

04:06.621 --> 04:07.580
[exhales]

04:08.289 --> 04:09.207
[Mu-deok] Young master.

04:09.290 --> 04:11.960
Please, go to your room.
I will bring you a towel.

04:20.093 --> 04:22.887
I do not know who
the final contender is going to be.

04:24.889 --> 04:26.766
But Uk will not be defeated that easily.

04:41.322 --> 04:42.156
Jang Uk!

04:46.619 --> 04:47.787
Where is…

04:48.371 --> 04:49.872
You must be here for your young master.

04:50.790 --> 04:51.666
Yes.

04:52.583 --> 04:53.751
Then I guess you're Mu-deok.

04:55.545 --> 04:57.588
- You're right.
- I thought so.

04:57.672 --> 05:00.633
You are the servant who is always
beside Young Master Jang Uk.

05:00.717 --> 05:02.051
[Mu-deok] That must be her,

05:02.135 --> 05:04.846
the white heron
Maidservant Kim talked about.

05:04.929 --> 05:07.140
I am waiting to see him before I go.

05:07.849 --> 05:09.267
Please, come in. Oh.

05:09.350 --> 05:12.312
I also brought some snacks.
Would you like some?

05:13.229 --> 05:14.147
No, thank you.

05:22.655 --> 05:25.783
She's just as graceful and gentle
as Maidservant Kim described.

05:36.961 --> 05:38.379
[breathes deeply]

06:05.281 --> 06:06.157
[Jang Uk sighs]

06:12.121 --> 06:12.955
[sighs]

06:26.010 --> 06:28.304
[Mu-deok] Why are you standing here
still soaking wet?

06:29.514 --> 06:31.349
Oh. Oh, watch this.

06:49.450 --> 06:50.910
This was how he did it earlier, right?

06:51.661 --> 06:53.830
[chuckles]
I should try it properly with a sword.

06:54.747 --> 06:57.583
I thought you would be discouraged
after being thrown into the pond,

06:58.501 --> 07:00.419
but you are reviewing the last fight.

07:00.920 --> 07:03.172
I could have been embarrassed
if I lost just once

07:03.256 --> 07:05.842
but it's hard to feel embarrassed
when you lost eight times.

07:07.927 --> 07:11.389
Seeing the young master who used to only
wear clothes that were neatly ironed

07:11.472 --> 07:14.350
not bathing even after
falling into filthy water,

07:15.476 --> 07:16.853
I guess you do feel the pressure.

07:18.688 --> 07:19.522
Oh.

07:20.106 --> 07:21.649
Gosh, I am filthy.

07:21.732 --> 07:22.567
[Jang Uk chuckles]

07:26.821 --> 07:28.823
You were too rushed in today's fight.

07:28.906 --> 07:30.575
If your opponent was casting a shield,

07:31.075 --> 07:33.453
you shouldn't have charged
toward them, but taken a step back

07:33.536 --> 07:35.288
and waited for him to drop his guard.

07:36.330 --> 07:37.165
Right.

07:37.665 --> 07:40.334
Had you taken a step back
after landing those blows,

07:40.418 --> 07:43.796
he definitely would have been careless,
stopped trying to defend himself,

07:43.880 --> 07:45.339
and start putting his guard down.

07:46.132 --> 07:47.925
Fighting is like a game of tug-of-war.

07:48.759 --> 07:51.512
Your opponent will pull
if you pretend it's down.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.557
That is the right moment
for you to strike.

07:56.309 --> 07:58.060
Thank you very much
for the advice, master.

08:03.566 --> 08:04.525
Where are you going?

08:06.068 --> 08:08.070
Hmm? I should go wash and change now.

08:08.154 --> 08:09.780
I think I smell terrible, too.

08:11.282 --> 08:13.117
You must be here for your young master.

08:13.201 --> 08:15.077
[soft music playing]

08:20.917 --> 08:21.834
Stop.

08:24.504 --> 08:25.338
[inhales]

08:25.922 --> 08:27.757
Don't go to your room and stay here.

08:28.758 --> 08:31.302
- I will go and bring your clothes.
- What for?

08:31.385 --> 08:33.137
I can just go and get changed myself.

08:34.180 --> 08:35.932
It doesn't make sense for you to go.

08:41.312 --> 08:42.188
You are right.

08:44.482 --> 08:45.858
It doesn't make sense at all.

08:50.571 --> 08:51.405
Go on.

08:56.160 --> 08:57.119
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

08:57.203 --> 08:58.621
Stop right there for a sec.

09:00.540 --> 09:01.499
Why?

09:08.589 --> 09:09.423
Sit down.

09:10.633 --> 09:11.509
Sit.

09:15.263 --> 09:16.097
[Jang Uk sighs]

09:17.682 --> 09:19.850
Gosh, your shoes are all wet, too.

09:23.145 --> 09:23.980
That's why…

09:25.231 --> 09:27.942
you should not have
followed me into the water.

09:30.820 --> 09:35.032
The more I look at you, the more
I realize you work too hard for nothing.

09:35.116 --> 09:37.368
Why do you put
so much effort into cleaning? Huh?

09:37.868 --> 09:40.121
Just use me as an excuse and take it easy.

09:40.705 --> 09:41.539
[Jang Uk sighs]

09:42.456 --> 09:45.418
And Maidservant Kim said
she sent abalones and dried fish.

09:45.501 --> 09:48.379
You should have some for yourself as well.
Don't just serve it all to me.

09:49.755 --> 09:50.881
Don't worry.

09:52.967 --> 09:54.969
I told them I'm close
to the heir, Dang-gu,

09:55.845 --> 09:57.179
so everyone is good to me.

09:59.265 --> 10:00.099
You did?

10:01.517 --> 10:03.019
Oh, I know you would never…

10:03.978 --> 10:06.188
pass up the chance
to take advantage of power.

10:12.653 --> 10:13.654
You are hurt.

10:16.574 --> 10:18.200
I've been fighting for eight days.

10:19.535 --> 10:20.870
Do you think that's the only one?

10:23.372 --> 10:24.582
Where else did you get hurt?

10:25.583 --> 10:27.501
Let's go to Sejukwon now
and get them treated.

10:27.585 --> 10:29.170
I'll be getting more injuries, anyway.

10:31.631 --> 10:32.965
I'll get injured enough…

10:34.800 --> 10:36.469
as much as my master expects.

10:37.136 --> 10:39.138
[soft music continues playing]

10:52.943 --> 10:53.986
Your feet will freeze.

10:55.363 --> 10:56.781
Go change your shoes, okay?

11:11.170 --> 11:12.046
[sighs]

11:35.986 --> 11:37.029
Hmm?

11:38.531 --> 11:39.407
Maidservant Kim?

11:53.546 --> 11:54.672
[eunuch] You are ready,
Your Royal Highness.

11:55.339 --> 11:58.342
The medicine is getting more bitter.
Do you have something sweet?

11:58.426 --> 12:00.594
I shall prepare
the sweetest snack for you.

12:18.195 --> 12:19.405
Should I just get rid of it?

12:23.617 --> 12:25.578
[whimsical music playing]

12:59.236 --> 13:00.112
[Jang Uk] What the…

13:01.155 --> 13:02.114
What is wrong with this?

13:05.659 --> 13:07.369
[heart thumping]

13:10.748 --> 13:12.917
[Jang Uk] What? What is this feeling?

13:16.462 --> 13:17.296
Uh…

13:25.221 --> 13:29.642
[Go Won] Someone is drawing me in
with immense power.

13:33.562 --> 13:35.105
[Jang Uk] This mysterious pulling…

13:36.232 --> 13:37.191
is calling me.

13:37.274 --> 13:39.610
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

14:07.012 --> 14:09.014
[heart thumping]

14:29.535 --> 14:31.036
- Ugh!
- Ugh!

14:31.120 --> 14:34.623
I mean, why in the world would you fill
somebody else's jade with energy

14:34.707 --> 14:35.541
and confuse me like that?

14:35.624 --> 14:37.501
That greatly offends me.

14:37.585 --> 14:38.419
I am also

14:38.502 --> 14:43.048
truly offended that you were the reason
why my heart had raced like that.

14:44.508 --> 14:45.342
Ugh!

14:47.887 --> 14:48.721
But, uh…

14:50.055 --> 14:51.140
did you feel it as well?

14:52.516 --> 14:55.936
A feeling like, thump, thump…

14:57.146 --> 14:58.480
[groans]

14:58.564 --> 15:00.316
- Ugh!
- Ugh, stop that! Ugh!

15:00.399 --> 15:02.109
[bird cawing]

15:03.027 --> 15:03.903
Enough!

15:05.029 --> 15:06.155
Judging by your surprise,

15:07.072 --> 15:09.033
it seems that
you have never used these properly.

15:09.909 --> 15:10.784
I suppose

15:10.868 --> 15:12.411
since your servant does not know magic,

15:13.078 --> 15:14.705
I doubt you two can share your energy.

15:14.788 --> 15:15.873
Yes, you're right.

15:16.415 --> 15:19.084
I didn't realize that
these jades had this kind of power.

15:26.383 --> 15:28.636
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

15:34.099 --> 15:36.393
- [song ends]
- Stop it! Stop! Stop it!

15:37.770 --> 15:39.772
- [sighs]
- Anyway,

15:40.564 --> 15:42.066
thanks to you, I learned what they can do.

15:42.983 --> 15:44.818
- Thank you, I guess.
- [Go Won] Why?

15:44.902 --> 15:45.986
Are you planning to use it?

15:47.029 --> 15:48.364
I doubt you'll be able to.

15:49.782 --> 15:51.158
Since you will not be getting this back.

15:51.241 --> 15:53.202
I still have two more chances, though.

15:53.744 --> 15:55.788
I will definitely get it back and use it.

15:55.871 --> 15:57.081
So, keep it safe until I do.

15:59.333 --> 16:00.376
And even as a joke,

16:01.502 --> 16:02.920
don't fill it with energy.

16:04.588 --> 16:06.423
Th-that's what I wanted to say to you!

16:11.804 --> 16:14.181
Your Royal Highness,
we've been looking for you.

16:15.599 --> 16:16.767
[Go Won] Should I take you in?

16:18.268 --> 16:19.311
I can if you want.

16:19.937 --> 16:22.231
I'm sure there will be things
for you to do in the palace.

16:23.732 --> 16:24.775
No, sir.

16:25.985 --> 16:27.695
- Eunuch Oh.
- Yes, Your Highness.

16:27.778 --> 16:30.698
Look into the mage who will be
fighting Jang Uk next time, yeah?

16:31.365 --> 16:32.241
Yes.

16:32.866 --> 16:33.742
Make sure you get it right.

16:34.702 --> 16:36.036
THE ART OF HYEONGONG

16:36.120 --> 16:38.205
Hey. How was Jang Uk, though?

16:38.998 --> 16:40.708
[Hyo] What? Jang Uk?
[scoffs]

16:40.791 --> 16:42.876
He really wasn't much of a challenge.

16:42.960 --> 16:45.170
- Are you ready?
- [Beom] Of course.

16:45.254 --> 16:48.173
At the end of the fight,
I will just use Hyeongong and bam…

16:48.257 --> 16:50.217
[laughter]

16:51.385 --> 16:54.054
[Mu-deok] A mage of the Cha family
who can use Hyeongong.

16:54.722 --> 16:58.934
A coward who only decided to challenge Uk
after seeing him lose all his matches.

17:01.562 --> 17:03.480
[Seo Yul] Uk might stand a chance
against Beom.

17:07.109 --> 17:10.112
Hyeongong looks flashy
on the outside, but it is…

17:10.821 --> 17:13.198
ineffective if the mage
who uses it lacks the skills.

17:14.116 --> 17:16.160
Cha Beom may look strong at first glance,

17:16.243 --> 17:17.661
but he's not as skilled as he seems.

17:18.704 --> 17:21.373
[Mu-deok] Seo Yul truly knows
how to see through others.

17:21.457 --> 17:22.583
Oh, is that so?

17:23.375 --> 17:25.669
But he was bragging to the others
that my young master

17:26.170 --> 17:27.963
would not stand a chance against him.

17:28.047 --> 17:29.131
He must be nervous.

17:30.007 --> 17:32.217
Uk has improved quite a lot
over the past few days,

17:33.052 --> 17:35.637
and Beom is worried that he might be
the one who ends up losing to him.

17:35.721 --> 17:36.764
[chuckles]

17:36.847 --> 17:41.101
My master must have improved
to make him really, really nervous.

17:43.937 --> 17:46.106
Are you that happy to see
that Uk has improved so much?

17:46.190 --> 17:49.109
Of course, I am!
I feel very proud just watching him.

17:50.486 --> 17:53.030
[Seo Yul] Naksu is training Uk.

17:53.572 --> 17:54.656
[Dang-gu pants] Yul.

17:57.534 --> 17:58.494
Have you heard?

17:58.994 --> 18:00.704
The capital is in an uproar right now.

18:01.663 --> 18:02.748
Know what happened?

18:02.831 --> 18:04.291
Master Kang of Daegangtongun

18:05.334 --> 18:06.460
passed away due to his illness.

18:07.920 --> 18:08.879
But rumor has it

18:09.630 --> 18:11.673
that he was attacked
by assassins last night.

18:12.966 --> 18:15.844
[Dang-gu] My uncle and Master Heo
have rushed over to his funeral.

18:16.428 --> 18:19.181
What if there are more assassins
like Naksu appeared?

18:19.264 --> 18:21.266
[suspenseful music playing]

18:31.193 --> 18:33.737
THE LATE KANG MAN-CHEON

18:35.697 --> 18:38.033
[Jin] Why can we not offer
our condolences?

18:39.827 --> 18:42.788
[mage] Our family business is
in transporting highly valuable items.

18:42.871 --> 18:45.916
But if people find out
that the head of the house

18:45.999 --> 18:49.253
was murdered by some assassins,
it will be problematic.

18:49.962 --> 18:51.547
We announced that
he died from a contagious disease,

18:52.131 --> 18:53.465
so we cannot allow any guests.

18:56.760 --> 18:58.428
Well, we understand your position.

18:58.512 --> 19:01.306
Have you found any evidence
of a suspect in the assassination?

19:03.267 --> 19:04.935
Has an autopsy been carried out?

19:06.770 --> 19:10.065
Master Kang was stabbed by assassins
and passed away in front of our very eyes.

19:10.649 --> 19:11.984
An autopsy is not needed.

19:13.610 --> 19:15.404
We're going to cremate his body tonight.

19:15.487 --> 19:17.030
You are cremating him tonight?

19:17.614 --> 19:18.740
It's unfortunate,

19:18.824 --> 19:20.659
but we must hurry if we are
to stop the rumors from spreading.

19:20.742 --> 19:23.162
We believe this is probably
what the late Master Kang

19:23.245 --> 19:24.663
would have wanted for his family as well.

19:24.746 --> 19:25.789
[Jin] That is unacceptable.

19:25.873 --> 19:28.000
If you just end up cremating his body,

19:28.792 --> 19:31.253
any evidence
regarding the assassins will be lost.

19:33.672 --> 19:35.048
This is a family matter.

19:36.466 --> 19:38.260
I understand you're concerned for us,

19:39.303 --> 19:42.598
but there is no need for the leader
of Songrim to get involved in this.

19:43.599 --> 19:45.559
An autopsy is needed.

19:46.101 --> 19:47.811
Postpone Master Kang's cremation.

19:49.229 --> 19:53.025
Is Songrim now going so far as to
meddle in other families' funeral matters?

19:56.403 --> 19:57.738
We are not meddling here.

19:58.488 --> 20:02.743
I'm merely trying to prevent
the new, young head of the family

20:02.826 --> 20:04.745
from making a terrible mistake.

20:04.828 --> 20:06.872
Why is the leader of Songrim
trying to do that?

20:06.955 --> 20:08.498
What gives Songrim the right?

20:08.582 --> 20:12.127
It has not been that long since
Naksu attacked mages in the capital.

20:12.211 --> 20:14.880
Now, new assassins have emerged
and a mage is dead.

20:14.963 --> 20:17.591
There could be a link between this
and Naksu who used sorcery.

20:18.425 --> 20:19.635
That is why I'm interfering.

20:20.844 --> 20:22.679
His death was not caused by sorcery.

20:22.763 --> 20:23.680
I saw it with my own eyes.

20:23.764 --> 20:25.641
How can you be sure without an autopsy?

20:27.059 --> 20:30.479
The new head of the family says
that he does not want an autopsy.

20:30.562 --> 20:32.773
Jin Mu! Stay out of this.

20:33.357 --> 20:36.151
It's the duty of Songrim
to suspect incidents of sorcery

20:36.235 --> 20:37.069
and investigate them.

20:37.152 --> 20:39.613
Is it not? Right, Lady Jin?

20:41.573 --> 20:42.407
I have to…

20:44.534 --> 20:47.120
agree with the Assistant Gwanju
on this matter.

20:51.041 --> 20:53.001
The heir of the family witnessed the death

20:53.585 --> 20:57.130
and he is saying that they have to
hide it for the sake of their business.

20:59.007 --> 21:01.969
There's no evidence to suggest
that sorcery was involved.

21:03.303 --> 21:07.140
So I do not think Songrim should
make a scene at a funeral.

21:13.981 --> 21:16.191
I'm just protecting
Master Kang's reputation.

21:16.275 --> 21:19.027
Please, allow us to hold
my late master's funeral

21:19.111 --> 21:20.112
and grieve in peace.

21:21.071 --> 21:23.073
[suspenseful music playing]

21:42.718 --> 21:45.929
Jin Mu, that scoundrel, is openly
disrespecting Songrim now!

21:46.013 --> 21:46.847
[Heo Yeom] Hmm.

21:48.015 --> 21:48.849
[sighs]

21:48.932 --> 21:51.101
I'm suspicious about why they are trying…

21:52.394 --> 21:54.563
- to keep us out.
- By the way,

21:54.646 --> 21:58.775
I did not expect Lady Jin to support
Jin Mu the way she did back there.

21:59.359 --> 22:01.695
She used to hate her younger half-brother.

22:03.030 --> 22:04.031
[both exhale]

22:05.907 --> 22:09.119
It brought me great joy to be
supported by my older sister.

22:10.996 --> 22:12.039
Just look.

22:12.122 --> 22:13.832
Against our combined strength,

22:13.915 --> 22:16.335
even Songrim had no choice
but to be forced to retreat.

22:18.086 --> 22:20.047
How close are you to finding Bu-yeon?

22:22.549 --> 22:24.968
I've searched everywhere
around Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

22:25.052 --> 22:28.096
for blind girls who are
around the same age as Bu-yeon's.

22:29.765 --> 22:33.268
I have already been doing that
for more than ten years now.

22:33.351 --> 22:34.394
The truth is…

22:35.187 --> 22:37.814
I believe I've found
the whereabouts of Bu-yeon.

22:39.274 --> 22:42.527
Ten years ago, a young girl washed up
on the shore of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

22:42.611 --> 22:43.445
[gasps]

22:44.279 --> 22:46.156
- Really?
- [Jin Mu] However…

22:48.075 --> 22:49.785
she had been dead for a long time.

22:49.868 --> 22:50.827
[inhales]

22:51.828 --> 22:53.038
[breathes shakily]

22:54.831 --> 22:55.707
[gasps]

22:56.708 --> 23:00.545
Mother, that body certainly cannot be her.

23:00.629 --> 23:03.256
I told my men to find the one
who buried her and dig up her grave.

23:04.091 --> 23:06.468
If Bu-yeon truly is dead,

23:06.551 --> 23:10.347
I will at least bring her body
back to you at all costs.

23:11.014 --> 23:12.516
No, that is unacceptable.

23:13.391 --> 23:16.061
Bring Bu-yeon back to me alive, Jin Mu.

23:17.229 --> 23:19.397
[Jin Mu] I will, so please calm yourself.

23:20.565 --> 23:22.526
We will find Bu-yeon alive and well.

23:22.609 --> 23:24.736
[whimpering]

23:38.458 --> 23:39.835
[Jin Mu] Did you take a good look?

23:40.919 --> 23:43.130
They will be your mother
and younger sister.

23:43.922 --> 23:44.756
Do you think…

23:45.924 --> 23:48.176
they will believe that I am her daughter?

23:48.260 --> 23:49.386
Dressed like this,

23:50.929 --> 23:53.807
you do resemble Bu-yeon a little
when she was younger.

23:53.890 --> 23:55.892
But I'm not sure if her mother will agree.

23:58.353 --> 24:00.355
Then being well-dressed like this…

24:02.399 --> 24:03.733
will not benefit us.

24:04.818 --> 24:07.362
I must look more pathetic and shabbier.

24:08.697 --> 24:10.699
She is a mother who has lost her daughter.

24:10.782 --> 24:15.120
I can only win her heart
if I succeed in tugging her heartstrings.

24:17.664 --> 24:18.623
That's true.

24:19.749 --> 24:21.459
You are quite right, So-i.

24:25.714 --> 24:26.715
I'll make sure…

24:29.676 --> 24:32.554
that I become
the lost daughter of the Jin family.

24:45.775 --> 24:47.194
[doctor] You look much better now.

24:47.986 --> 24:50.238
Yes, I don't know why
but I tend to recover pretty quickly.

25:01.625 --> 25:03.668
Ugh, this Hyeongong technique…

25:04.753 --> 25:06.004
is quite elaborate.

25:08.340 --> 25:09.257
[sighs]

25:12.135 --> 25:15.931
[Jin] Something about Master Kang's death
does not sit right with me.

25:21.269 --> 25:22.103
[Jang Uk] Oh.

25:28.318 --> 25:32.072
[Jin] The late Master Kang
was indeed powerful.

25:32.155 --> 25:34.824
But he was already suffering
from a terminal illness.

25:35.617 --> 25:38.995
There was no need for anyone
to go so far as to assassinate him.

25:39.079 --> 25:41.206
Perhaps someone had a grudge against him,

25:41.998 --> 25:44.084
enough to kill him before he died.

25:44.167 --> 25:46.836
No. There's got to be a reason

25:48.213 --> 25:50.715
why those assassins came
that we're missing now.

25:53.802 --> 25:57.138
Once the soul has been shifted,
we are left with a useless body.

25:57.681 --> 25:59.724
But we can't get rid of it so easily.

25:59.808 --> 26:03.270
Because in the eyes of others, the body
that's left behind belongs to a mage,

26:03.353 --> 26:05.355
an administrative officer, or a merchant.

26:05.897 --> 26:08.525
So it'll look suspicious
if such an individual disappears.

26:10.318 --> 26:15.031
And Naksu was very useful in
disposing of such bodies inconspicuously.

26:15.115 --> 26:17.158
Do you mean the Shadow Assassin, Naksu?

26:19.494 --> 26:22.080
Thanks to their discovery
of Naksu, that wild assassin,

26:22.664 --> 26:26.960
the soul shifters I have made have been
able to evade Songrim's suspicion.

26:28.295 --> 26:30.130
[Jin] Back when I was after Naksu,

26:30.672 --> 26:34.175
I thought she was just a lunatic
who wanted to show off her skills.

26:34.259 --> 26:38.221
That's why I was never suspicious
of the individuals she had killed before.

26:40.849 --> 26:42.767
Then now you're saying
that she killed those

26:43.518 --> 26:45.812
whose souls have been shifted by Jin Mu?

26:45.895 --> 26:47.230
If I am to be exact,

26:48.398 --> 26:51.484
they must have been those
who were discarded later.

26:51.568 --> 26:54.195
[Master Lee] You said that Naksu was
Cho Chung's daughter, yes?

26:54.988 --> 26:59.326
Are you saying he took that little girl
and turned her into an assassin?

27:01.661 --> 27:03.997
[Jin Mu] That is why
I never revealed myself to her,

27:04.748 --> 27:06.875
and made her live
in the mountains all by herself.

27:08.460 --> 27:10.587
I took care of her just enough to survive.

27:11.546 --> 27:15.467
But she was the one who was determined
and ended up growing to be so strong.

27:17.093 --> 27:18.553
Because that child…

27:19.137 --> 27:23.558
She probably obeyed Jin Mu,
thinking she'd be avenging her parents.

27:25.477 --> 27:27.187
[Jin Mu] She was very useful.

27:28.521 --> 27:31.232
But then a soul shifter ran wild
before she could kill them.

27:32.108 --> 27:33.401
Because of that,

27:34.444 --> 27:36.696
Songrim learnt about the alchemy of souls.

27:37.739 --> 27:39.908
Once Songrim was after Naksu,

27:40.742 --> 27:43.453
Jin Mu was probably afraid
of his deeds being exposed.

27:44.245 --> 27:49.167
So he had to send Naksu to Songrim,
fully aware that she would die.

27:49.250 --> 27:51.544
[action music playing]

28:02.472 --> 28:04.724
[female servant] Mu-deok,
go and draw some water.

28:04.808 --> 28:05.642
Yes, ma'am.

28:07.102 --> 28:07.936
[grunts]

28:14.442 --> 28:17.695
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok, are you determined
to not listen to me?

28:17.779 --> 28:19.823
I told you to take it easy
and get some rest.

28:22.826 --> 28:23.743
Then what about you?

28:24.494 --> 28:26.454
Did I not tell you to treat your wounds?

28:26.538 --> 28:29.749
I just stopped by Sejukwon.
You know I listen to my master well.

28:31.418 --> 28:32.293
What?

28:33.461 --> 28:34.504
Check for yourself.

28:37.465 --> 28:39.175
[sniffs] I smell mugwort.

28:46.433 --> 28:47.684
What are you doing?

28:47.767 --> 28:51.104
[Jang Uk] You know that I'm working hard
these days. I'm just so exhausted.

28:58.319 --> 28:59.446
You're very warm.

29:02.407 --> 29:03.992
Did you get a mugwort massage?

29:05.326 --> 29:07.370
Hmm-mm. I am warm, right?

29:08.830 --> 29:11.374
Yes. You are warm.

29:15.670 --> 29:17.964
[Master Lee] She was used
for all the wrong reasons,

29:18.047 --> 29:19.466
and met a terrible death.

29:20.008 --> 29:21.009
Naksu…

29:21.593 --> 29:23.928
how void of warmth
her life must have been.

29:24.512 --> 29:26.514
[soft music playing]

29:33.938 --> 29:35.482
You are cool now. Let me go.

29:38.359 --> 29:40.945
- [Jang Uk] Did you change your shoes?
- Yes.

29:41.571 --> 29:43.156
Did you eat Maid Kim's food?

29:43.239 --> 29:46.534
Yes. Actually, I'd already had some
before you mentioned it.

29:46.618 --> 29:49.078
[chuckles] Well done. Mu-deok.

29:51.122 --> 29:54.375
See this? It turns out
it's quite fascinating.

29:56.503 --> 29:57.587
The yin-yang jade?

29:57.670 --> 29:59.672
I only found out since
you gave it to the Crown Prince.

30:00.423 --> 30:02.008
How is it fascinating?

30:02.091 --> 30:04.052
- Show me.
- I cannot. I cannot.

30:04.135 --> 30:05.720
I will get yours back

30:05.804 --> 30:07.931
and return it to you. Then I'll show you.

30:09.432 --> 30:10.517
When it's retrieved,

30:11.726 --> 30:13.061
you're going to return it to me?

30:14.896 --> 30:17.315
What? Aren't you going to accept it?

30:20.985 --> 30:24.656
I will retrieve it and make sure
to place it on your hand.

30:24.739 --> 30:27.534
This jade has unbelievable powers.

30:27.617 --> 30:28.952
It's a good thing we did not know.

30:29.035 --> 30:31.579
You're going to be in
for a shock once I get it back.

30:35.667 --> 30:37.669
What kind of powers? Show me.

30:38.503 --> 30:41.297
When the Crown Prince saw it,
he foamed at the mouth and fainted.

30:41.965 --> 30:42.966
It was terrifying.

30:43.466 --> 30:45.969
That makes sense. It was from Jinyowon.

30:46.052 --> 30:48.054
For all we know,
it could be a lethal weapon.

30:48.721 --> 30:49.556
[chuckles]

30:56.354 --> 30:58.398
[tense music playing]

31:10.743 --> 31:12.328
Welcome, Assistant Gwanju.

31:17.834 --> 31:20.920
The leader of Songrim has returned
to watch the cremation

31:21.004 --> 31:22.547
for himself in person.

31:23.214 --> 31:25.341
Under what pretense
have you come this time?

31:25.425 --> 31:28.177
I'm only here to pay my respects.

31:29.137 --> 31:31.472
This is the last time I will ever see him.

31:32.181 --> 31:34.601
I believe that I have a duty
to at least see him off.

31:46.988 --> 31:49.365
[crowd crying]

31:50.783 --> 31:51.618
[worker] My lord!

31:54.037 --> 31:55.955
[crying continues]

31:56.039 --> 31:56.956
[worker] My lord!

32:07.508 --> 32:09.928
[Jin] You have seen a soul shifter before,

32:10.553 --> 32:12.472
so you will recognize their blue mark.

32:13.389 --> 32:16.768
Check and see if Master Kang's body
had been used for soul shifting.

32:16.851 --> 32:19.103
Even if we find out
that he has shifted souls,

32:19.187 --> 32:21.356
we will not know
whose body he has shifted into.

32:22.732 --> 32:26.694
There is something you must do
to help us find out what happened.

32:27.403 --> 32:29.280
[suspenseful music playing]

32:58.393 --> 33:01.729
I know that you have
already mastered Chisu, Yul.

33:02.939 --> 33:04.857
I wasn't hiding it intentionally.

33:04.941 --> 33:06.359
I am not scolding you.

33:07.360 --> 33:08.987
What I'm about to ask you to do

33:09.070 --> 33:11.531
is a dangerous task in which
your energy may be taken.

33:12.407 --> 33:14.742
Only those
who have mastered Chisu can do it.

33:15.827 --> 33:18.955
[Jin] The body of a soul shifter runs wild
once its energy is lost.

33:19.706 --> 33:21.958
The corpse is still warm.

33:22.875 --> 33:25.044
Put your energy in that body,

33:25.753 --> 33:28.339
and make Master Kang's body run wild.

33:32.760 --> 33:34.762
[crowd crying]

33:55.533 --> 33:57.201
[crying continues]

33:59.537 --> 34:00.705
- [coffin rattles]
- [worker shrieks]

34:00.788 --> 34:02.123
What's the matter?

34:03.041 --> 34:04.333
- [worker 1 stammers] He is…
- [worker 2] Look! Look!

34:10.631 --> 34:12.133
[workers gasping]

34:19.140 --> 34:21.726
I will take care of his bones myself,
so everyone, step aside.

34:24.812 --> 34:27.732
This is a soul shifter

34:27.815 --> 34:30.985
who has been petrified after running wild.

34:33.654 --> 34:37.033
Now that we have clear evidence
of sorcery being involved, can Songrim…

34:38.493 --> 34:40.661
step in to investigate what happened here?

34:48.211 --> 34:52.548
Seeing how you are not disturbed at all
and even tried to hide it,

34:53.174 --> 34:55.593
you must have already known.

34:57.929 --> 34:58.971
You already knew

34:59.639 --> 35:04.519
that this was a soul shifter
who had run wild.

35:06.395 --> 35:07.230
[scoffs]

35:09.899 --> 35:10.733
[young mage grunts]

35:12.735 --> 35:14.695
[suspenseful music playing]

35:17.073 --> 35:18.324
[young mage grunting]

35:23.830 --> 35:24.956
[young mage groans]

35:26.666 --> 35:27.542
[pants]

35:28.251 --> 35:30.044
Judging by your skills,

35:30.128 --> 35:33.256
I suppose the soul within that body
is you, Master Kang.

35:34.924 --> 35:36.801
Then that body's original soul

35:36.884 --> 35:38.970
must be already dead within your body.

35:39.053 --> 35:40.763
Do not speak nonsense!

35:40.847 --> 35:41.848
[yelps]

35:43.391 --> 35:44.225
[grunts]

35:48.980 --> 35:50.398
[grunting]

35:55.903 --> 35:56.737
[groans]

36:00.241 --> 36:01.450
You're running wild

36:02.034 --> 36:03.995
after having lost blood and energy.

36:07.165 --> 36:10.501
If you continue to use your skills,
you'll be petrified faster.

36:11.127 --> 36:12.420
I suggest you stop.

36:18.968 --> 36:20.595
Do not resist any further.

36:27.351 --> 36:29.353
- Do not kill him!
- Kill him.

36:29.437 --> 36:31.772
[tense music playing]

36:31.856 --> 36:33.357
[mages grunting]

36:34.942 --> 36:36.861
[intense music playing]

37:13.606 --> 37:15.524
[shouts]

37:16.859 --> 37:18.903
[intense music continues playing]

37:24.116 --> 37:25.034
[yells]

37:26.619 --> 37:27.536
[grunts]

37:40.591 --> 37:41.550
[yells]

37:57.191 --> 37:58.359
[exhales]

38:06.284 --> 38:08.286
[music intensifies]

38:14.875 --> 38:17.211
A soul shifter who is running wild
is dangerous.

38:17.712 --> 38:19.505
Thankfully, Cheonbugwan got rid of him.

38:20.089 --> 38:21.590
Since you have helped us,

38:21.674 --> 38:24.927
we will allow you
to take credit for catching him.

38:29.056 --> 38:30.808
- [Yeom-su] My lord.
- Hmm?

38:41.152 --> 38:43.571
Since you said Songrim could take credit,

38:43.654 --> 38:45.698
we will take the body with us
and examine it.

38:48.284 --> 38:49.160
Be my guest.

39:02.923 --> 39:04.592
I closed his gate of energy

39:04.675 --> 39:07.094
to prevent any more energy
from seeping out.

39:08.137 --> 39:10.139
We need to revive him and make him talk.

39:11.223 --> 39:12.433
Will it be possible?

39:13.017 --> 39:15.478
Well, he is pretty much a breathing stone.

39:15.561 --> 39:17.480
You want me to revive him
and make him speak?

39:17.563 --> 39:19.023
This will not be easy.

39:27.406 --> 39:30.451
Are you worried
that he may actually still be alive?

39:32.870 --> 39:34.872
Even still, how would they save him?

39:35.581 --> 39:37.958
Perhaps they could
with the power of the ice stone.

39:38.667 --> 39:40.252
But without it, it's impossible.

39:40.920 --> 39:43.964
Are you saying it's possible
with the power of the ice stone?

39:44.048 --> 39:44.924
That is correct.

39:46.133 --> 39:48.677
And are you saying that
you have such stone in your possession?

39:49.887 --> 39:51.263
You don't need to know that.

39:52.640 --> 39:54.475
For now, get the assassins ready.

39:55.226 --> 39:56.185
I will find a way

39:56.268 --> 39:59.438
even if it means I have to shift
the soul of a Jeongjingak mage.

40:06.570 --> 40:07.488
Hey, you're ready?

40:08.447 --> 40:09.740
- [Beom] What?
- Let's go.

40:18.124 --> 40:19.375
THE ART OF HYEONGONG

40:19.458 --> 40:21.043
PRESSING THE HEAD OF A LEOPARD STANCE

40:21.127 --> 40:22.962
DIRECT SENDING STANCE,
CAULDRON STANCE

40:38.644 --> 40:39.645
[grunts]

40:41.897 --> 40:43.399
[breathes shakily]

40:51.782 --> 40:53.701
[somber music playing]

41:39.747 --> 41:40.831
[sighs softly]

41:54.136 --> 41:55.221
[sighs]

41:56.305 --> 41:57.473
Yul.

41:59.308 --> 42:00.267
Oh, Uk.

42:01.602 --> 42:02.978
Are you on your way to train?

42:04.146 --> 42:04.980
Yes.

42:05.981 --> 42:06.815
And you?

42:12.947 --> 42:14.031
I just cut down…

42:16.200 --> 42:17.493
a soul shifter.

42:21.413 --> 42:24.542
Master Kang, a man
who died yesterday, was a soul shifter.

42:26.043 --> 42:26.877
Really?

42:27.545 --> 42:29.296
How did you know he was a soul shifter?

42:30.714 --> 42:32.258
If they hide their blue mark,

42:32.341 --> 42:34.552
they can easily blend in
with other people.

42:35.553 --> 42:36.971
But once they run wild,

42:38.430 --> 42:39.682
there is no turning back.

42:46.814 --> 42:49.567
They start to harden like a stone
as their energy seeps out.

42:50.442 --> 42:53.487
They can prevent the petrification
by feeding on others' energy.

42:55.072 --> 42:56.490
But once they do that, they are…

42:58.617 --> 43:00.411
no longer human but a monster.

43:03.789 --> 43:04.748
A monster?

43:20.014 --> 43:22.349
Protecting this world from such monsters…

43:26.562 --> 43:27.521
is our duty.

43:36.780 --> 43:39.366
We can also choose to protect
the monsters from this world.

43:41.285 --> 43:42.911
If we keep the monsters in check,

43:43.746 --> 43:45.164
the world won't worry about them.

43:46.915 --> 43:49.501
Everyone had high hopes for you
ever since you were little,

43:49.585 --> 43:52.546
so you think that
you need to do something grand. But…

43:52.630 --> 43:53.881
but I was told…

43:55.257 --> 43:57.134
not to do anything my whole life.

43:59.720 --> 44:00.929
So I'm…

44:02.556 --> 44:04.266
I'm going to follow my heart from now on.

44:30.834 --> 44:34.129
[eunuch] Jin Mu has lost
something critical to Songrim.

44:34.213 --> 44:36.924
What if Songrim suspects
the royal palace as well?

44:37.675 --> 44:38.801
The Royal Palace…

44:39.968 --> 44:44.431
is not a place they can just barge into
as they did at Daegangtongun.

44:44.515 --> 44:48.143
But if they do, though,
I will be in danger.

44:48.227 --> 44:51.855
Ever since Gil-ju of Cheonbugwan died,
I haven't been able to feed.

44:53.649 --> 44:56.151
I am afraid I will run wild.

44:59.738 --> 45:02.116
Could you also share the power

45:03.033 --> 45:04.618
of the ice stone with me?

45:06.078 --> 45:06.954
Say again.

45:07.037 --> 45:10.499
Am I not the only person here
who can serve you despite knowing…

45:14.753 --> 45:16.296
your true identity?

45:17.548 --> 45:18.674
Shaman.

45:20.092 --> 45:21.635
How dare you, you scum!

45:21.718 --> 45:24.221
I told you never
to address me like that again.

45:26.265 --> 45:28.517
Would you like
to be petrified this instant?

45:28.600 --> 45:30.144
[laughs]

45:31.186 --> 45:32.312
I know you can't.

45:33.981 --> 45:36.608
I am the only person
in this palace who knows that,

45:36.692 --> 45:39.528
despite you residing in the Queen's body,

45:39.611 --> 45:42.656
in truth, you are actually Shaman Choi.

45:44.158 --> 45:45.534
If you kill me,

45:45.617 --> 45:49.830
who will bring your sibling here
from Jinyowon then?

45:51.081 --> 45:51.957
[scoffs]

45:52.040 --> 45:53.125
[laughs]

45:54.209 --> 45:55.210
And also,

45:56.170 --> 46:01.091
speaking of the real Queen
who is residing in your true body.

46:03.218 --> 46:07.264
Should I try visiting her
from time to time?

46:08.265 --> 46:09.683
[laughs]

46:13.645 --> 46:15.481
It is getting difficult for me

46:16.732 --> 46:18.650
to live any longer in this body.

46:20.736 --> 46:22.279
Why don't you go ahead

46:22.946 --> 46:26.575
and tell the Assistant Gwanju
to shift my soul into a new body…

46:28.494 --> 46:29.745
Your Royal Highness.

46:33.207 --> 46:34.291
I understand.

46:35.542 --> 46:36.877
You may leave now.

46:40.422 --> 46:41.298
[relieved sigh]

46:43.300 --> 46:44.718
[laughter]

46:48.972 --> 46:50.140
[exhales shakily]

46:55.145 --> 46:56.146
[sighs]

46:59.942 --> 47:00.776
Hmm.

47:03.070 --> 47:04.238
What are you doing here?

47:05.197 --> 47:07.407
[whispers]
I'll let you win, and it will be over.

47:07.491 --> 47:09.701
- [whimsical music playing]
- Ah.

47:12.329 --> 47:14.164
I yield! I yield.

47:14.748 --> 47:16.041
Hey, Uk! Come back!

47:16.542 --> 47:17.417
[sighs]

47:23.340 --> 47:24.841
[Beom] You wanted to go before me.

47:24.925 --> 47:25.801
And you won.

47:33.267 --> 47:35.227
Dang-gu was willing to let you beat him.

47:35.727 --> 47:37.062
How could you refuse?

47:37.145 --> 47:39.523
I had no idea you had
this much pride in yourself.

47:39.606 --> 47:42.526
Hey, you looked at me like this,
telling me not to fight him.

47:42.609 --> 47:43.694
When did I?

47:43.777 --> 47:45.612
The look I gave you
was only out of relief.

47:45.696 --> 47:47.364
Then you should have sent me a signal.

47:48.115 --> 47:49.032
Like that.

47:49.116 --> 47:50.409
I did send you a signal!

47:51.493 --> 47:54.121
How was I supposed to know that?
If so, I would have just done it.

47:55.414 --> 47:56.248
[sighs]

47:56.331 --> 47:57.749
You only have one chance left.

47:58.625 --> 47:59.876
What will you do now?

47:59.960 --> 48:01.461
What's going on here? You're blaming me?

48:02.087 --> 48:04.673
Why are you getting mad at me
when you're the one who gave him that?

48:04.756 --> 48:06.800
Are you seriously
pointing fingers right now?

48:07.551 --> 48:08.844
You're so childish.

48:08.927 --> 48:11.513
Childish? Do you want me
to show you what childish is?

48:11.597 --> 48:12.472
I quit.

48:13.599 --> 48:14.600
Should I keep this up?

48:14.683 --> 48:15.517
[scoffs]

48:24.735 --> 48:27.279
Mages have been guarding
Sejukwon since last night.

48:28.572 --> 48:31.491
The body of the soul shifter
they caught yesterday must be in there.

48:31.575 --> 48:33.994
But if it's a corpse,
why not put it in the Secret Room.

48:34.911 --> 48:36.955
Why in Sejukwon where they save lives?

48:46.590 --> 48:50.052
I came by because I was curious
about the body brought here yesterday.

48:50.135 --> 48:52.387
Please, wait here. I will go
and inform our leader right now.

49:09.071 --> 49:12.491
I heard the leader was here at Sejukwon,
so I decided to come see him.

49:12.574 --> 49:15.077
No one is allowed
to enter Sejukwon at the moment.

49:15.160 --> 49:17.412
Then please tell Lord Jin that I am here.

49:17.496 --> 49:19.414
I should go and meet
with Young Master Jang first.

49:21.208 --> 49:22.459
Jin Mu must have…

49:23.835 --> 49:26.755
come to check whether or not
the soul shifter has really died.

49:27.964 --> 49:30.342
Tell him to leave
since we are still investigating.

49:30.425 --> 49:33.512
Yes, my lord. However,
someone else is here to see you, too.

49:34.513 --> 49:35.472
Tell them

49:35.555 --> 49:38.141
absolutely no one is allowed
anywhere near Sejukwon.

49:38.225 --> 49:39.184
[Sang-ho] Yes, my lord.

49:39.267 --> 49:41.728
I shall also tell
Maidservant Kim to leave.

49:43.021 --> 49:43.855
Hmm?

49:45.315 --> 49:46.400
Maidservant Kim?

49:46.483 --> 49:49.945
I will go and tell her now
that you are unable to meet anyone.

49:52.322 --> 49:53.490
Wait! Hold on.

49:54.783 --> 49:57.994
Maidservant Kim is not "anyone", is she?

50:07.879 --> 50:10.257
Maidservant Kim, it has been a long time.

50:13.135 --> 50:14.761
[tense music playing]

50:16.304 --> 50:17.764
[gasps, chuckles softly]

50:29.568 --> 50:32.988
I had so much of your delicious cooking
when I stayed at Jang Gang's residence

50:33.655 --> 50:36.616
back when I was serving
the Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

50:37.743 --> 50:39.202
You always ate so much

50:39.703 --> 50:43.123
that we served your rice
in a noodle bowl instead of a plate.

50:43.206 --> 50:44.291
[chuckles softly]

50:44.374 --> 50:46.126
Do you remember? [chuckles]

50:46.209 --> 50:48.628
That brass bowl was so big.

50:48.712 --> 50:52.507
Back then, I was always hungry,
no matter what I ate. [chuckles]

50:52.591 --> 50:56.178
Oh, you must have made
something scrumptious once again.

50:56.762 --> 51:00.599
I did. I brought
some snacks I made myself.

51:02.017 --> 51:02.851
[exhales]

51:04.060 --> 51:07.647
Honey biscuits. I used to
absolutely love these back then.

51:07.731 --> 51:08.940
[maid Kim] Yes, indeed.

51:09.024 --> 51:12.027
Every time I gave you some
to give to the Gwanju,

51:12.110 --> 51:15.155
you would often stash
a few of them in your pockets. Remember?

51:15.238 --> 51:16.281
[chuckles]

51:16.364 --> 51:18.325
I was only allowed to eat
whatever the Gwanju left,

51:18.408 --> 51:20.035
so that was the only way
I could have my share.

51:20.952 --> 51:24.998
In any case, I benefited a lot
from following Jang Gang.

51:25.081 --> 51:27.125
I got to taste such delicacy,

51:28.084 --> 51:30.504
and even learned a special spell or two.

51:32.756 --> 51:34.716
[tense music playing]

51:35.717 --> 51:39.137
Everything tastes so much sweeter
when you eat it in secret, does it not?

51:43.141 --> 51:44.100
[chuckles]

51:45.936 --> 51:46.812
That's exactly…

51:48.104 --> 51:50.565
why sweets are very dangerous things.

51:50.649 --> 51:54.653
Once you get a taste of it,
you will desire it at all costs.

51:58.031 --> 51:59.616
You fail to distinguish

52:01.159 --> 52:02.536
what you can have and…

52:04.454 --> 52:05.622
what you cannot have.

52:08.250 --> 52:11.002
You are hurting my feelings
if you stop me like this.

52:13.004 --> 52:16.550
Oh, goodness, there is no reason
for you to be so stingy with food.

52:20.720 --> 52:24.057
I remember the Gwanju
used to love this snack.

52:24.140 --> 52:26.017
I wonder what his son thinks about them.

52:26.101 --> 52:29.145
I know Young Master Jang Uk loves
these honey biscuits as well.

52:29.229 --> 52:31.690
Then why don't we ask him to join us
and share these with him?

52:32.941 --> 52:37.153
I have many stories
I want to tell him about his father.

52:40.407 --> 52:41.241
[Jim Mu chuckles]

52:44.744 --> 52:48.039
You and Uk have absolutely
nothing to talk about.

52:48.123 --> 52:49.833
[Jin] So you should leave now.

52:49.916 --> 52:52.752
He just wants a biscuit. Why are you
being like this? All heartless.

52:53.461 --> 52:56.631
They are such happy memories of mine,
yet you will not let me share them.

52:56.715 --> 52:57.674
I suppose…

52:59.467 --> 53:01.928
you must not want me
to touch what is yours.

53:03.179 --> 53:04.014
[maid Kim gasps]

53:04.598 --> 53:05.724
Wait. In that case…

53:06.766 --> 53:09.978
here, I packed these for the young master,

53:10.061 --> 53:11.605
but you can have them instead.

53:12.147 --> 53:13.231
[Jin] Maidservant Kim.

53:14.149 --> 53:15.358
Don't give that to him.

53:16.359 --> 53:18.153
If I truly wanted to have some,

53:18.862 --> 53:21.323
do you think I would not
have been able to sneak a few?

53:22.073 --> 53:24.200
[Jin Mu] I'm merely letting you have them.

53:26.661 --> 53:30.916
It had been a while since we last met.
I am sad to say goodbye.

53:39.883 --> 53:42.427
Jin Mu used to
hold a grudge and take revenge

53:42.510 --> 53:44.012
if he was scolded for eating something.

53:44.763 --> 53:46.264
He only wanted some biscuits.

53:46.348 --> 53:47.974
You should have just let him have them.

53:48.058 --> 53:50.143
I just did not want to see him eating…

53:51.603 --> 53:55.315
the honey biscuits
that you worked so hard to make.

53:57.192 --> 53:58.234
Please, sit.

53:58.318 --> 53:59.986
We have not seen each other in a while.

54:00.570 --> 54:03.990
Why don't we just chat over a cup of tea?

54:07.619 --> 54:08.954
Is something wrong?

54:10.163 --> 54:11.706
You seem rather on edge.

54:12.415 --> 54:13.249
[sighs]

54:15.710 --> 54:16.753
Do not worry.

54:18.171 --> 54:22.467
Once I have some sweets,
I will feel much better for sure.

54:32.435 --> 54:33.728
[maid Kim] Oh, Mu-deok.

54:34.896 --> 54:36.523
I need you to run an errand.

54:36.606 --> 54:38.566
Run an errand? What is it?

54:38.650 --> 54:39.859
I need you to go to Cheonbugwan.

54:40.986 --> 54:44.364
I just do not feel right about this.
I should send these over.

54:45.699 --> 54:46.950
All right.

54:47.033 --> 54:48.410
[indistinct chattering]

54:51.705 --> 54:53.623
Is something going on at Sejukwon?

54:54.708 --> 54:57.210
I actually don't know the details.

54:57.293 --> 55:01.047
But I think it might be related to
last night's incident at Daegangtongun.

55:01.673 --> 55:03.758
I heard Cheonbugwan
and Songrim had an argument.

55:09.222 --> 55:10.098
Where is Yul?

55:10.181 --> 55:11.891
I haven't seen him since last night.

55:11.975 --> 55:13.893
I'm sure he must be
doing something for the leader.

55:15.145 --> 55:15.979
Huh…

55:17.856 --> 55:18.898
[Seo Yul] I just cut down…

55:21.276 --> 55:22.235
a soul shifter.

55:35.290 --> 55:37.042
We must strengthen our boundaries.

55:37.542 --> 55:40.962
So all mages are forbidden
from leaving Songrim for the time being.

55:42.297 --> 55:44.049
Those who have mastered Ryusu or higher

55:44.132 --> 55:47.552
shall all proceed to Sejukwon
and follow Sang-ho's orders.

55:47.635 --> 55:48.511
[all mages] Yes, my lord.

55:49.137 --> 55:50.138
[Jin] Jang Uk.

55:51.890 --> 55:52.891
You will stay here.

55:54.309 --> 55:56.019
Everyone, except for Uk,

55:56.102 --> 55:58.897
follow Sang-ho
and go to Sejukwon right now.

55:58.980 --> 55:59.981
[mages] Yes, my lord.

56:05.820 --> 56:06.654
Wait.

56:07.947 --> 56:09.783
Why am I the only one not going there?

56:09.866 --> 56:12.660
You are exempt from it
since we don't need you there.

56:13.912 --> 56:15.789
There's something dangerous at Sejukwon?

56:16.831 --> 56:18.208
Is it a soul shifter?

56:18.792 --> 56:20.877
This matter is none of your concern, so…

56:21.628 --> 56:23.046
don't be curious about it.

56:23.129 --> 56:25.840
I'm also a mage here.
Why am I being left out?

56:25.924 --> 56:29.344
You are an exception to all things.

56:29.928 --> 56:32.722
If you are bored
being by yourself, you may leave.

56:32.806 --> 56:36.184
Go back to your home and just do
whatever makes you comfortable.

56:37.644 --> 56:38.770
[sighs]

56:38.853 --> 56:42.357
Yes, thank you for worrying
about my comfort, my lord.

56:51.991 --> 56:52.909
[sighs]

57:00.458 --> 57:01.292
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

57:02.794 --> 57:05.004
Let's go to Chwiseonru
and have something tasty.

57:06.631 --> 57:08.508
All the mages were headed to Sejukwon.

57:09.259 --> 57:10.677
Where are you going now?

57:11.678 --> 57:14.430
I was told to stay out of it because

57:14.514 --> 57:16.224
they're such trivial matters, you know.

57:16.808 --> 57:19.435
- Let's go.
- I have to go on an errand for Maid Kim.

57:20.145 --> 57:22.605
Is that so? Perfect, let's go together.
Where to, though?

57:23.523 --> 57:24.566
Cheonbugwan.

57:26.401 --> 57:27.235
Let's go.

57:32.073 --> 57:36.703
Eunuch Kim, I heard that you demanded
to be shifted into another body.

57:38.788 --> 57:39.914
Can you do that?

57:40.915 --> 57:42.876
Then shift my soul into the body of a girl

57:42.959 --> 57:45.086
who will enter Jinyowon as Jin Bu-yeon.

57:47.547 --> 57:48.965
I have been a eunuch for a while,

57:50.008 --> 57:51.718
so I don't mind a woman's body.

57:52.510 --> 57:57.432
This time, I would like to shift my soul
into a powerful body like Shaman Choi has.

57:59.225 --> 58:00.351
Shaman Choi.

58:01.686 --> 58:03.938
She told me she was offended
by how you reminded her

58:04.022 --> 58:07.692
that she used to be a shaman dealing
with trivialities like divinations.

58:07.775 --> 58:09.360
I was only stating a fact.

58:09.444 --> 58:10.278
[scoffs]

58:11.821 --> 58:16.493
I was also reminded earlier today of how
I used to beg for food and steal snacks.

58:18.161 --> 58:19.412
They were actually true,

58:20.538 --> 58:22.290
but I do not wish to hear them.

58:23.750 --> 58:24.584
[exhales softly]

58:32.133 --> 58:35.220
Jin Mu wanted a honey biscuit
while visiting Songrim,

58:35.303 --> 58:37.096
but Park Jin didn't let him have any.

58:37.805 --> 58:39.724
Maid Kim was worried he'd hold a grudge,

58:39.807 --> 58:41.768
so she wanted me to deliver this.

58:41.851 --> 58:44.812
[Jang Uk] Are you telling me they were
childish enough to fight over some food?

58:44.896 --> 58:47.649
The leader does have
a tendency to be petty sometimes.

58:47.732 --> 58:50.568
Why could he not have given
just one biscuit to him? Gosh!

58:50.652 --> 58:52.946
I know. He's so petty.

58:56.241 --> 58:57.075
[Jang Uk sighs]

58:59.869 --> 59:01.621
[somber music playing]

59:13.049 --> 59:13.883
[sighs]

59:27.730 --> 59:29.440
I will tell the Assistant Gwanju that

59:29.524 --> 59:31.192
these honey biscuits
were from the Jang family.

59:32.068 --> 59:35.613
Please, be sure to tell him that they are
from Maidservant Kim of the Jang family.

59:36.906 --> 59:39.242
Tell him that we use
a lot of oil in our biscuits

59:39.325 --> 59:41.619
and that they are better
when you pair it with green tea.

59:41.703 --> 59:42.787
Yes, Young Master Jang.

59:42.870 --> 59:45.498
And we also use a lot of honey
in our honey biscuits.

59:45.582 --> 59:47.875
They get sticky, so you should store them
in a cool place.

59:47.959 --> 59:49.377
- Yes.
- And since we have brought

59:49.460 --> 59:51.796
these honey biscuits as a gift,
can I look inside of Cheonbugwan?

59:51.879 --> 59:53.047
Yes-- Sorry?

59:53.131 --> 59:54.924
Thank you so much.
It'll only take a second.

59:55.008 --> 59:56.634
Let's go. Mm-hmm.

59:57.594 --> 59:58.428
But…

01:00:01.389 --> 01:00:02.223
[sighs]

01:00:06.519 --> 01:00:08.313
[Jang Uk] I have always wanted to visit.

01:00:08.396 --> 01:00:11.858
Despite my father being the Gwanju,
I've never been to this place.

01:00:16.362 --> 01:00:18.239
Wow, look at that. What is it?

01:00:20.450 --> 01:00:23.036
I thought you had been here before.

01:00:23.119 --> 01:00:25.830
Did you say your father was
a constellation recorder mage?

01:00:26.539 --> 01:00:28.333
Did you bring me
all the way here for this?

01:00:29.375 --> 01:00:30.209
Mm-hmm.

01:00:30.960 --> 01:00:32.629
I'm sure you could have
just asked somebody else

01:00:32.712 --> 01:00:34.130
to run Maidservant Kim's errand.

01:00:34.714 --> 01:00:37.759
Didn't you come
because you wanted to come here?

01:00:40.803 --> 01:00:41.638
[sighs]

01:00:42.555 --> 01:00:45.475
My father used to bring me here
often when I was little.

01:00:46.601 --> 01:00:49.771
He even showed me the plate
that was recorded the day I was born.

01:00:51.481 --> 01:00:53.024
Your father was very sweet.

01:00:56.694 --> 01:00:57.612
Come to think of it,

01:00:58.237 --> 01:01:01.616
he should have recorded the constellations
on the day you were born, too.

01:01:03.785 --> 01:01:04.619
Is that so?

01:01:05.203 --> 01:01:06.037
[inhales sharply]

01:01:06.537 --> 01:01:09.874
Then my constellations
must also be here somewhere.

01:01:17.048 --> 01:01:18.132
- [sword clinks]
- [eunuch grunts]

01:01:22.387 --> 01:01:23.304
[groans]

01:01:23.388 --> 01:01:25.848
You said you would shift my soul,

01:01:26.474 --> 01:01:29.102
but instead, you're making me run wild.

01:01:29.769 --> 01:01:31.104
You are no longer needed.

01:01:31.854 --> 01:01:33.981
So you might as well just turn to stone.

01:01:34.065 --> 01:01:35.191
- [sword whooshes]
- [grunts in pain]

01:01:37.193 --> 01:01:38.027
- [grunts]
- [Jin Mu] Agh!

01:01:38.986 --> 01:01:39.862
[grunts]

01:01:49.997 --> 01:01:51.124
You've lost your mind!

01:01:51.624 --> 01:01:53.084
[pants]

01:01:55.294 --> 01:01:57.296
[groaning]

01:02:10.226 --> 01:02:12.103
Once night falls, the mages will come.

01:02:13.020 --> 01:02:14.564
Shall we watch them
record the constellations?

01:02:14.647 --> 01:02:16.816
I heard that the sight is to behold.

01:02:19.026 --> 01:02:22.739
I do want to see it, but it will be
such a nuisance if we get caught.

01:02:22.822 --> 01:02:24.365
- Let's just go home.
- [eunuch groaning]

01:02:29.704 --> 01:02:31.247
[breathes heavily]

01:02:37.712 --> 01:02:39.255
Eunuch Kim has run wild.

01:02:39.338 --> 01:02:41.716
You must not let anyone find out
that he's a soul shifter.

01:02:42.300 --> 01:02:45.720
He's still in Cheonbugwan.
We must find him before the break of dawn.

01:02:45.803 --> 01:02:46.679
[Yeom-su] Yes, my lord.

01:02:51.434 --> 01:02:53.436
[ominous music playing]

01:03:21.339 --> 01:03:22.173
[scoffs]

01:03:30.389 --> 01:03:31.641
[Jin Mu] I know you are here.

01:03:32.391 --> 01:03:34.018
There's no need to hide anymore.

01:03:34.101 --> 01:03:35.812
I will give you what you want.

01:03:44.487 --> 01:03:45.613
Come out now.

01:03:47.949 --> 01:03:49.867
- Come out!
- [Jang Uk] I'm coming out.

01:03:54.997 --> 01:03:56.707
- Jang Uk.
- [laughs]

01:04:02.421 --> 01:04:04.465
What are you doing here at this hour?

01:04:04.549 --> 01:04:06.217
I'm sorry. I was running an errand

01:04:06.300 --> 01:04:07.844
and decided to take a quick look around.

01:04:12.223 --> 01:04:13.307
What kind of errand?

01:04:13.933 --> 01:04:17.520
Well, I heard that you really wanted
to try some of our honey biscuits.

01:04:18.688 --> 01:04:19.689
Honey biscuits?

01:04:20.189 --> 01:04:22.191
Maidservant Kim sent some over because

01:04:22.275 --> 01:04:24.026
you looked sad
that you didn't get to have any.

01:04:26.654 --> 01:04:29.073
I can see that. Tell her I said thank you.

01:04:29.824 --> 01:04:30.658
[Jang Uk] What?

01:04:32.368 --> 01:04:35.288
I thought you'd be upset
that I came without asking.

01:04:36.038 --> 01:04:36.914
Are you not angry?

01:04:36.998 --> 01:04:40.293
Why would I be?
You brought me snacks. You may leave now.

01:04:41.669 --> 01:04:43.588
[exhales] What a relief! To be honest…

01:04:45.131 --> 01:04:46.132
I have someone else with me.

01:04:47.550 --> 01:04:49.427
Mu-deok, come out. He says it's fine.

01:04:50.553 --> 01:04:52.471
She is the servant who came with me.

01:04:54.015 --> 01:04:55.808
Hello, sir. My name is Mu-deok,

01:04:55.892 --> 01:04:57.435
Young Master Jang's servant.

01:04:59.979 --> 01:05:01.522
So, you were here as well.

01:05:02.231 --> 01:05:04.233
[Jang Uk] I thought you would be furious.

01:05:04.317 --> 01:05:07.445
I am truly grateful that you're so kind.

01:05:07.528 --> 01:05:08.821
Please, enjoy the honey biscuits.

01:05:08.905 --> 01:05:11.657
And please, let us know
if you would like some more of them.

01:05:13.993 --> 01:05:15.244
Thank you so much.

01:05:15.328 --> 01:05:16.203
Let's go.

01:05:19.415 --> 01:05:20.291
[chuckles softly]

01:05:26.547 --> 01:05:27.882
[eunuch groaning]

01:05:31.636 --> 01:05:34.847
That man… is a royal eunuch.

01:05:35.890 --> 01:05:37.099
[Jang Uk] What is wrong with him?

01:05:38.559 --> 01:05:39.852
That is a soul shifter.

01:05:40.853 --> 01:05:43.439
Look. He's petrifying.

01:05:51.405 --> 01:05:53.741
So they even had
a soul shifter in the palace.

01:05:53.824 --> 01:05:54.742
It's probably…

01:05:55.826 --> 01:05:57.119
Jin Mu who did this.

01:06:00.456 --> 01:06:01.749
[Jin Mu] I know you are here.

01:06:02.333 --> 01:06:04.168
There's no need to hide anymore.

01:06:04.835 --> 01:06:06.545
I will give you what you want.

01:06:10.549 --> 01:06:11.717
[breathes heavily]

01:06:13.344 --> 01:06:14.220
Come out!

01:06:14.845 --> 01:06:16.847
[suspenseful music playing]

01:06:23.354 --> 01:06:24.438
I'm coming out.

01:06:50.506 --> 01:06:51.424
Run.

01:06:54.844 --> 01:06:56.095
There's also a backdoor.

01:06:56.178 --> 01:06:58.180
[suspenseful music continues playing]

01:07:08.232 --> 01:07:09.066
[exhales]

01:07:09.150 --> 01:07:10.735
Why won't you let us leave?

01:07:11.736 --> 01:07:15.823
I don't think it's right to let a mage
who barged in here leave so easily.

01:07:15.906 --> 01:07:18.075
I'm certain that you'll be in a tight spot

01:07:19.076 --> 01:07:20.536
if I disappear from Cheonbugwan.

01:07:20.619 --> 01:07:22.079
Did I say I would harm you?

01:07:23.539 --> 01:07:25.458
Your body will be left intact.

01:07:35.051 --> 01:07:35.968
Jang Uk.

01:07:45.978 --> 01:07:47.980
[tense music playing]

01:07:58.032 --> 01:07:58.991
[shouts]

01:08:03.537 --> 01:08:04.371
[grunts]

01:08:32.817 --> 01:08:34.318
[breathes heavily]

01:08:38.614 --> 01:08:40.908
[Jin Mu] You are within a barrier
that I have made.

01:08:45.496 --> 01:08:46.622
Do not worry.

01:08:47.498 --> 01:08:49.875
You will be safe if you remain still.

01:08:51.252 --> 01:08:53.170
You should try to wait there for a while.

01:09:06.725 --> 01:09:08.227
Mu-deok, was it?

01:09:09.895 --> 01:09:12.690
So, the maidservant who followed
Uk around like his shadow

01:09:12.773 --> 01:09:16.152
and was always causing trouble was you.

01:09:19.446 --> 01:09:21.240
There's a human over here.

01:09:21.949 --> 01:09:24.076
So come out
and regain your energy at last!

01:09:30.708 --> 01:09:32.751
[ominous music playing]

01:09:35.754 --> 01:09:37.214
Then, I will let you live

01:09:37.798 --> 01:09:41.719
in the body of a noble young master
as you wished.

01:09:42.970 --> 01:09:44.972
[ominous music continues playing]

01:09:52.146 --> 01:09:53.522
[breathing heavily]

01:10:01.864 --> 01:10:04.491
In any case, I need your help this time.

01:10:04.575 --> 01:10:07.453
If you don't trust me,
I will stay outside.

01:10:09.455 --> 01:10:11.624
So, do with her however you please.

01:10:12.833 --> 01:10:14.835
[tense music playing]

01:10:46.700 --> 01:10:48.202
[Jang Uk breathing shakily]

01:11:03.259 --> 01:11:04.635
I need to get out of here.

01:11:05.219 --> 01:11:06.053
[Jang Uk yelps]

01:11:06.136 --> 01:11:07.429
[pants]

01:11:17.606 --> 01:11:19.608
[tense music continues playing]

01:11:27.866 --> 01:11:29.243
[roars]

01:11:35.332 --> 01:11:36.709
[pants]

01:11:39.211 --> 01:11:40.045
[eunuch grunting]

01:11:43.924 --> 01:11:44.758
[groans]

01:11:48.095 --> 01:11:49.471
[breathes heavily]

01:11:55.561 --> 01:11:57.104
[breathes shakily]

01:12:00.024 --> 01:12:02.693
Master, can you please once again

01:12:03.444 --> 01:12:05.779
give your hesitant pupil a push off
the edge of the cliff.

01:12:08.490 --> 01:12:09.742
[breathing heavily]

01:12:13.579 --> 01:12:14.621
[laughs softly]

01:12:17.333 --> 01:12:18.167
Jang Uk.

01:12:33.307 --> 01:12:35.309
[intense music playing]

01:12:52.201 --> 01:12:53.327
[gasps]

01:12:58.624 --> 01:12:59.666
Mu-deok.

01:13:02.211 --> 01:13:03.379
Mu-deok!

01:13:11.595 --> 01:13:12.471
[gasps]

01:13:19.228 --> 01:13:21.230
[intense music playing]

01:13:36.245 --> 01:13:37.371
Hey, Mu-deok.

01:14:00.477 --> 01:14:01.311
[exhales]

01:14:05.774 --> 01:14:06.859
Hey, Mu-deok.

01:14:10.279 --> 01:14:11.155
I…

01:14:13.740 --> 01:14:15.701
I just fed on the eunuch's energy.

01:14:22.916 --> 01:14:23.834
Am I…

01:14:25.752 --> 01:14:27.004
going to run wild?

01:14:31.467 --> 01:14:33.469
[somber music playing]

01:14:41.643 --> 01:14:44.146
- Mu-deok.
- Do not come near me, Uk.

01:14:57.034 --> 01:14:58.243
No, you're fine.

01:14:59.244 --> 01:15:00.621
You're fine. You're fine.

01:15:02.456 --> 01:15:04.041
- You're fine, all right?
- No.

01:15:05.209 --> 01:15:06.251
Don't touch me.

01:15:08.337 --> 01:15:09.963
If I am truly running wild…

01:15:12.257 --> 01:15:13.800
and if you then touch me…

01:15:17.596 --> 01:15:19.139
I will feed on your energy

01:15:20.182 --> 01:15:21.183
and kill you.

01:15:36.949 --> 01:15:38.951
["You're Everything to Me"
by Shin Yong Jae playing]

01:17:01.658 --> 01:17:04.536
There was a loud noise
from the Constellation Basin room.

01:17:05.078 --> 01:17:06.038
Come on out!

01:17:06.121 --> 01:17:09.041
Is it because you're angry that we turned
your friend back there into stone?

01:17:09.124 --> 01:17:11.877
[Jin Mu] You will not be able
to leave this place anyway.

01:17:12.669 --> 01:17:15.005
Is there someone from the Cho family?

01:17:15.088 --> 01:17:16.423
What if her soul really is here?

01:17:17.507 --> 01:17:18.925
[Master Lee] What if
it's lingering near the young master?

01:17:19.009 --> 01:17:22.929
[Seo Yul] If I had not left you
there in the mountains back then,

01:17:23.013 --> 01:17:24.931
you wouldn't be suffering like this.

01:17:25.015 --> 01:17:26.433
[Go Won] You said you'd bet your life?

01:17:27.392 --> 01:17:28.518
Good.

01:17:28.602 --> 01:17:30.228
I'll win tomorrow for sure.

01:17:30.312 --> 01:17:32.397
[Go Won] This time, I need someone
who will win for sure.

01:17:32.481 --> 01:17:35.067
[Seo Yul] If the way to protect her
is to find the ice stone…

01:17:35.150 --> 01:17:36.151
Those two can't be together.

01:17:36.234 --> 01:17:38.695
Everything about you has been exposed.
